Rāma laments senseless like orphan --- Lakṣmaṇa clasps feet and consoles Rāma --- Lakṣmaṇa recalls Daśaratha won by austerities --- Lakṣmaṇa cites fallen Yayāti and bereaved Vasiṣṭha --- Lakṣmaṇa says sun moon earth obey fate --- Lakṣmaṇa bids wise not grieve like common men --- Lakṣmaṇa urges effort against known foe